; addquad_sample_register: ADDQUAD requires MODEL mode.
;
; The write twin of setquad_sample_register. ADDQUAD reads the existing
; coefficient and adds to it, so it is the one of the trio that both reads
; and writes the quadratic map a sample does not have.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a SAMPLE, not a model

PUSH 0           ; i
PUSH 1           ; j
PUSH 5           ; delta
ADDQUAD r0
HALT
